WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.799
- Taylor, I got your email!

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:06.142
(door slams)

00:00:06.142 --> 00:00:07.604
- Have a seat.

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:13.230
I don't know if you heard but uh,

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.322
someone stole my lunch today.

00:00:15.322 --> 00:00:16.666
- That's horrible.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:18.734
Who would do such a thing?

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:21.676
- Who would do such a thing.

00:00:22.006 --> 00:00:25.112
I have witnesses that can put
you at the scene of the crime!

00:00:26.023 --> 00:00:29.453
(suspenseful dramatic music)

00:00:32.106 --> 00:00:33.150
Jason, you know you're getting

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.682
quite the reputation around here.

00:00:34.682 --> 00:00:36.866
Do you remember Claudia's cupcakes

00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:39.490
that went missing about three weeks ago?

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.906
- Yeah I remember.

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:42.346
- Oh you remember that.

00:00:42.346 --> 00:00:43.646
How about all the cupcake wrappers

00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:46.195
that showed up in your trash can?

00:00:46.222 --> 00:00:47.266
- Someone gave them to me.

00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:49.125
I didn't know that they were stolen.

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:49.869
- Right.

00:00:49.869 --> 00:00:52.842
Where were you at 12:11 PM today?

00:00:52.842 --> 00:00:54.049
- At my desk.

00:00:54.049 --> 00:00:56.554
- And who might have
seen you at your desk?

00:00:56.554 --> 00:00:58.042
- Uh Mike and uh--

00:00:58.042 --> 00:00:58.853
- Okay.

00:00:58.853 --> 00:01:00.177
Jason, Jason, Jason,

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:01.989
I don't have time for this, okay.

00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:03.473
I'm about to get real hangry.

00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:05.937
You don't wanna see me when I get hangry.

00:01:05.937 --> 00:01:07.444
- I didn't do it!

00:01:07.444 --> 00:01:10.134
- Take a look at these.

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.461
Do you know what these are?

00:01:12.461 --> 00:01:13.576
- Oh my god.

00:01:13.576 --> 00:01:15.989
- That's the contents of my lunch.

00:01:15.989 --> 00:01:17.404
- Oh god.

00:01:17.404 --> 00:01:19.149
- What's wrong, you look at little queasy.

00:01:19.149 --> 00:01:21.192
- I can't look, I'm so full.

00:01:21.192 --> 00:01:23.670
- Of all the food you stole!

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.624
Where's my lunch?

00:01:25.624 --> 00:01:26.392
(loud bang)

00:01:26.392 --> 00:01:28.222
- I don't know, I swear!

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:29.619
- Hey, sorry to bother you

00:01:29.619 --> 00:01:31.684
but I think I accidentally
grabbed your bag.

00:01:31.684 --> 00:01:32.567
- Ah no worries.

00:01:32.567 --> 00:01:34.448
Yes girl, thank you.

00:01:34.448 --> 00:01:35.954
- You're welcome.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:39.942
(suspenseful dramatic music)

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:43.289
- Hey Jason, have you
seen my water bottle?

00:01:43.289 --> 00:01:45.395
- I didn't take it!

